urce, and double click the Shader to open it in the Shader Editor.\n5. Close the Editor\n6. Re-Open the Editor\n7. The editor throws the error, and fails to restore the viewed Sub_Resource Shader in the Shader Editor Plugin.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102642/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}